OL,3,CFather hails 16-year-old lifeguard who
OL,4,Csaved his son from strong waves
OL,6,FThe father of a 10-year-old who was
OL,7,Frescued from pounding surf off the
OL,8,FCalifornia coast in a dramatic scene
OL,9,Fcaptured on video said he is beyond
OL,10,Fgrateful to the teenage lifeguard who
OL,11,Fsaved him.
OL,13,F"What he did, I can never ever repay,"
OL,14,FSumit Rai, who was in his home city of
OL,15,FDallas when the incident happened,
OL,16,Fsaid. "I'm forever grateful."
OL,26,@uD@AOUxD@]O]
