OL,3,CFather hails 16-year-old lifeguard who
OL,4,Csaved his son from strong waves
OL,6,FRai's son, Nathaniel, was standing in
OL,7,Fshallow water at Seabright Beach in
OL,8,FSanta Cruz on Saturday when he lost
OL,9,Fhis footing and was pulled into the
OL,10,Focean.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FRai said he heard about what happened
OL,18,Fwhen he spoke to his kids on the phone
OL,19,Fthat evening.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
