OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785421093
OL,3,CFather hails 16-year-old lifeguard who
OL,4,Csaved his son from strong waves
OL,6,F"My son told me that he drowned and
OL,7,Fthat he went unconscious," he said.
OL,8,F"He was very subdued, still in a state
OL,9,Fof shock."
OL,11,FCalifornia State Parks, which employs
OL,12,Fthe lifeguards at that beach, said the
OL,13,Fboy was swept about 14 metres into the
OL,14,Focean before the lifeguard made
OL,15,Fcontact with him.
OL,17,FLifeguard Ryder Williams, 16, said he
OL,18,Fsaw Nathaniel lose his footing in
OL,19,Fankle-deep water and raced toward him.
