OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785421093
OL,3,CFather hails 16-year-old lifeguard who
OL,4,Csaved his son from strong waves
OL,6,FThe dramatic rescue lasted over a
OL,7,Fminute
OL,9,F"After the first wave, I was unable to
OL,10,Fpull him out because he was limp and
OL,11,Fthe waves were pushing so hard," he
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FIn the video, Williams can be seen
OL,15,Fdiving into a coming wave while
OL,16,Fholding tight to the boy. For over a
OL,17,Fminute, Williams is seen clutching the
OL,18,Fboy as he struggles to keep them above
OL,19,Fthe water, battered by strong waves.
OL,26,@qD@AOUsD@`O]
