CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785421093
OL,3,CFather hails 16-year-old lifeguard who
OL,4,Csaved his son from strong waves
OL,6,FAnother lifeguard jumped in to help,
OL,7,Falong with some bystanders, who
OL,8,FWilliams said he warned to return to
OL,9,Fthe shore.
OL,11,FAfter Williams successfully pulled the
OL,12,Fboy to a safe point where others could
OL,13,Fassist him, bystanders on the beach
OL,14,Fclapped and cheered.
OL,16,F"I'm grateful to have had the
OL,17,Fopportunity to return the child to his
OL,18,Ffamily safely," he said. "This is my
OL,19,Fjob and I love what I do. I'm thankful
OL,20,Fto my fellow lifeguards who perform
OL,21,Frescues just like this every day."
OL,26,@xD@AOUzD@OO]zD@ZOU}D@bO]
