PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1785421093
OL,3,CFather hails 16-year-old lifeguard who
OL,4,Csaved his son from strong waves
OL,6,FPresident Trump acknowledged Williams'
OL,7,Fheroism, writing on Truth Social that
OL,8,Fhe wants to invite the lifeguard, his
OL,9,Ffamily, and the boy he saved to the
OL,10,FWhite House to receive "a high
OL,11,Fcivilian honour".
OL,13,FThe boy had no serious injuries, and
OL,14,Fafter a medical evaluation he was
OL,15,Freleased to his family, the California
OL,16,FState Parks said in an emailed
OL,17,Fstatement.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
