OL,3,CFather hails 16-year-old lifeguard who
OL,4,Csaved his son from strong waves
OL,6,FRai said his son, who is expected back
OL,7,Ffrom California in a few days, told
OL,8,Fhim that he got sand in his lungs and
OL,9,Fis dealing with the psychological
OL,10,Feffects of what happened.
OL,12,F"He's still been thinking about it a
OL,13,Flot. It's on his mind," he said. "It
OL,14,Fbothers him when he's sleeping. So
OL,15,Fit's obviously traumatising."
OL,26,@tD@AOUuD@WO]uD@bOUwD@]O]
